      <item>
        <title>Schedule for Friday, November 20, 2026</title>
        <link>https://www.democrats.senate.gov/2026/11/19/schedule-for-friday-november-20-2026</link>
        <pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 23:22:00 EST</pubDate>
        <dc:creator>
          <![CDATA[The Senate Democratic Caucus]]>
        </dc:creator>
        <category>
          <![CDATA[Senate Schedule]]>
        </category>
        <guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.democrats.senate.gov/2026/11/19/schedule-for-friday-november-20-2026</guid>
        <description>
          <![CDATA[<p><font face="Arial">The Senate
stands adjourned until 10:00am on Friday, November 20, 2026.</font></p><p><font face="Arial">&nbsp;</font></p><p><font face="Arial">Following
Leader remarks, the Senate will proceed to Executive Session and resume
consideration of Executive Calendar #968 Richard
Wesley Bennett, of Texas, to be United States District Judge for the Southern
District of Texas, post-cloture.</font></p><p><font face="Arial">&nbsp;</font></p><p><font face="Arial">At
approximately 11:00am, the Senate will vote on confirmation of the Bennett
nomination. Following disposition of the nomination, the Senate will vote on
the motion to invoke cloture on Executive Calendar #969 Courtney Leigh Coker,
of Texas, to be United States District Judge for the Northern District of
Texas.</font></p><p><font face="Arial">&nbsp;</font></p><p><font face="Arial">Additional
roll call votes are expected during Friday’s session. Senators will be notified
as votes are scheduled. &nbsp;</font></p><p><font face="Arial">&nbsp;</font></p><p><font face="Arial">As
a reminder, cloture has been filed on the following:</font></p><ol style="margin-top:0in">
 <li style="margin-left: 0in;"><font face="Arial">Executive
     Calendar #969 Courtney Leigh Coker, of Texas, to be United States District
     Judge for the Northern District of Texas</font></li>
 <li style="margin-left: 0in;"><font face="Arial">Executive
     Calendar #970 Kyle Frederick Reardon, of Alaska, to be United States
     District Judge for the District of Alaska</font></li>
 <li style="margin-left: 0in;"><font face="Arial">Executive
     Calendar #967 Daniel Lewis Ballou, of Kentucky, to be United States
     District Judge for the Eastern District of Kentucky</font></li>
</ol><p><font face="Arial">&nbsp;</font></p><p><u><font face="Arial">Friday,
November 20<sup>th</sup> at approx. 11:00am – 2 roll call votes expected:</font></u></p><p>

























</p><ol style="margin-top:0in">
 <li style="margin-left: 0in;"><font face="Arial">Confirmation
     of Executive Calendar #968 Richard Wesley Bennett, of Texas, to be United
     States District Judge for the Southern District of Texas</font></li>
 <li style="margin-left: 0in;"><font face="Arial">Motion
     to invoke cloture on Executive Calendar #969 Courtney Leigh Coker, of
     Texas, to be United States District Judge for the Northern District of
     Texas</font></li>
</ol>]]>
        </description>
      </item>
      <item>
        <title>Wrap Up for Thursday, November 19, 2026</title>
        <link>https://www.democrats.senate.gov/2026/11/19/wrap-up-for-thursday-november-19-2026</link>
        <pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 23:22:00 EST</pubDate>
        <dc:creator>
