        </dc:creator>
        <category>
          <![CDATA[Wrap Up]]>
        </category>
        <guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.democrats.senate.gov/2026/11/19/wrap-up-for-thursday-november-19-2026</guid>
        <description>
          <![CDATA[<p><b><font face="Arial">Roll Call
Votes</font></b></p><ol style="margin-top:0in">
 <li style="margin-left: 0in;"><span style="color: windowtext;"><font face="Arial">On H.Con.Res.93, Iran War Powers; not agreed to: 48-51.</font></span></li>
 <li style="margin-left:0in;"><font face="Arial">Passage
     of Cal. #453 H.R.2347 Bipartisan American Affordability and Jobs Act, as
     amended; passed: 62-33.</font></li>
 <li style="margin-left: 0in;"><font face="Arial"><span style="color: windowtext;">Motion to invoke cloture on </span>Executive
     Calendar #968 Richard Wesley Bennett, of Texas, to be United States
     District Judge for the Southern District of Texas; invoked: 48-46.</font></li>
</ol><p><font face="Arial">&nbsp;</font></p><p><b><font face="Arial">Legislative
Business</font></b></p><p><font face="Arial">Passed the
following bills:</font></p><p><font face="Arial">S.3321, FAIR
Leave Act</font></p><p><font face="Arial">H.R.1520
Charlotte Woodward Organ Transplant Discrimination Prevention w/Moody-Hassan
sub amdt</font></p><p><font face="Arial">Cal. #473,
S.1135, Bonneville Shoreline Trail</font></p><p><font face="Arial">Cal. #658,
S.4538, Washington’s Trail</font></p><p><font face="Arial">Cal. #632,
S.1288, Finger Lakes National Heritage Act</font></p><p><font face="Arial">Cal. #657,
S.4238, Endless Mountains National Heritage Area Act</font></p><p><font face="Arial">H.R.973,
Setting Consumer Standards for Lithium-Ion Batteries Act</font></p><p><font face="Arial">H.R.4624, Muhammad Ali American Boxing Revival Act w/Cruz-Rosen sub amdt </font></p><p><font face="Arial">S.4035, DEATH
Bets w/Schiff-Curtis amdt</font></p><p><font face="Arial">S.2479,
Reserve Organization of America Charter Amendments Act, w/Blackburn sub amdt </font></p><p><font face="Arial">Cal. #129,
S.580 – Combating CCP Labor Abuses Act w/Peters sub amdt and Peters title amdt </font></p><p><font face="Arial">Cal. #691,
S.4448 – Accelerating Broadband Permits Act</font></p><p><font face="Arial">&nbsp;</font></p><p><font face="Arial">Adopted the
following resolutions:</font></p><p><font face="Arial">S.Res.858 –
Constance Benjamin Clery</font></p><p><font face="Arial">S.Res.964 -
National Adoption Day and Month </font></p><p><font face="Arial">S.Res.965 -
Milwaukee Brewers </font></p><p><font face="Arial">S.Res.966 -
National Rural Health Day </font></p><p><font face="Arial">&nbsp;</font></p><p>



















































</p><p><b><font face="Arial">No
additional Executive Business</font></b></p>]]>
        </description>
      </item>
      <item>
        <title>Wrap Up for Wednesday, November 18, 2026</title>
        <link>https://www.democrats.senate.gov/2026/11/18/wrap-up-for-wednesday-november-18-2026</link>
        <pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 19:31:00 EST</pubDate>
