      <item>
        <title>Schedule for Wednesday, November 18, 2026</title>
        <link>https://www.democrats.senate.gov/2026/11/17/schedule-for-wednesday-november-18-2026</link>
        <pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 18:19:00 EST</pubDate>
        <dc:creator>
          <![CDATA[The Senate Democratic Caucus]]>
        </dc:creator>
        <category>
          <![CDATA[Senate Schedule]]>
        </category>
        <guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.democrats.senate.gov/2026/11/17/schedule-for-wednesday-november-18-2026</guid>
        <description>
          <![CDATA[<p><span style="font-family: Arial;">The Senate
stands adjourned until 10:00am on Wednesday, November 18, 2026.</span></p><p><font face="Arial">&nbsp;</font></p><p><font face="Arial">Following
Leader remarks, the Senate will resume consideration of Capito substitute
amendment #6883, post-cloture.</font></p><p><font face="Arial">&nbsp;</font></p><p><font face="Arial">At
approximately 11:45am, if no further agreement is reached, all post-cloture
time will be considered expired on Capito substitute amendment #6883. If a
budget point of order is raised against the substitute amendment, senators
should expect a roll call vote on a motion to waive applicable budget points of
order. Then, the Senate is expected to vote adoption of Capito substitute
amendment #6883. Following that vote, the Senate is expected to vote on the
motion to invoke cloture on Cal. #453 H.R.2347 Bipartisan American
Affordability and Jobs Act, as amended, if amended. </font></p><p><font face="Arial">&nbsp;</font></p><p><font face="Arial">As
a reminder, cloture has been filed on the following:</font></p><ol style="margin-top:0in">
 <li style="margin-left: 0in;"><font face="Arial">Executive
     Calendar #968 Richard Wesley Bennett, of Texas, to be United States
     District Judge for the Southern District of Texas</font></li>
 <li style="margin-left: 0in;"><font face="Arial">Executive
     Calendar #969 Courtney Leigh Coker, of Texas, to be United States District
     Judge for the Northern District of Texas</font></li>
 <li style="margin-left: 0in;"><font face="Arial">Executive
     Calendar #970 Kyle Frederick Reardon, of Alaska, to be United States
     District Judge for the District of Alaska</font></li>
 <li style="margin-left: 0in;"><font face="Arial">Executive
     Calendar #967 Daniel Lewis Ballou, of Kentucky, to be United States
     District Judge for the Eastern District of Kentucky</font></li>
</ol><p><font face="Arial">&nbsp;</font></p><p><font face="Arial">Additional
roll call votes are possible during Wednesday’s session.</font></p><p><font face="Arial">&nbsp;</font></p><p><u><font face="Arial">Wednesday,
November 18<sup>th</sup> at approx. 11:30am – up to 3 roll call votes expected:</font></u></p><p>

























</p><ol style="margin-top:0in">
 <li style="margin-left:0in;"><font face="Arial">Motion to waive budget points of order re: Capito
     substitute amendment #6883</font></li>
 <li style="margin-left:0in;"><font face="Arial">Adoption of Capito substitute amendment
     #6883</font></li>
 <li style="margin-left: 0in;"><span style="color: windowtext;"><font face="Arial">Motion to invoke cloture on Cal. #453 H.R.2347
     Bipartisan American Affordability and Jobs Act, as amended, if amended</font></span><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;"></span></li>
</ol>]]>
        </description>
      </item>
      <item>
        <title>Wrap Up for Tuesday, November 17, 2026</title>
