following bills:</font></p><p><font face="Arial">H.R. 8454,
Ackerson Meadow Land Exchange </font></p><p><font face="Arial">H.R. 5254,
Gateway Partnership Act </font></p><p><u><span style="text-decoration:none"><font face="Arial">&nbsp;</font></span></u></p><p><font face="Arial">Adopted the
