National Hazing Awareness Week</font></p><p><font face="Arial">S.Res.949,
Loggers Day</font></p><p><font face="Arial">S.Res.959,
Former Senator John Davison “Jay” Rockefeller IV</font></p><p><font face="Arial">&nbsp;</font></p><p><u><font face="Arial">Amendments
pending to Cal. #453, H.R.2347, BAAJA:</font></u></p><ul style="margin-top:0in">
 <li style="margin-left:0in;"><font face="Arial">Thune
     for Capito substitute <a href="https://ats.senate.gov/Display.aspx?ID=6883">#6883</a></font></li>
 <li style="margin-left:0in;"><font face="Arial">Thune
     <a href="https://ats.senate.gov/Display.aspx?ID=6884">#6884</a> to #6883</font></li>
 <li style="margin-left:0in;"><font face="Arial">Thune
     <a href="https://ats.senate.gov/Display.aspx?ID=6885">#6885</a> to #6884</font></li>
 <li style="margin-left:0in;"><font face="Arial">Thune
     <a href="https://ats.senate.gov/Display.aspx?ID=6886">#6886</a> to the
     underlying bill</font></li>
 <li style="margin-left:0in;"><font face="Arial">Thune
     <a href="https://ats.senate.gov/Display.aspx?ID=6887">#6887</a> to #6886</font></li>
</ul><p><font face="Arial">&nbsp;</font></p><p><font face="Arial">Notwithstanding
Rule 22, at a time to be determined by the Majority Leader, in concurrence with
