      <item>
        <title>Schedule for Pro Forma Sessions and Monday November 9, 2026</title>
        <link>https://www.democrats.senate.gov/2026/09/30/schedule-for-pro-forma-sessions-and-monday-november-9-2026</link>
        <pubDate>Wed, 30 Sep 2026 23:27:00 EST</pubDate>
        <dc:creator>
          <![CDATA[The Senate Democratic Caucus]]>
        </dc:creator>
        <category>
          <![CDATA[Senate Schedule]]>
        </category>
        <guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.democrats.senate.gov/2026/09/30/schedule-for-pro-forma-sessions-and-monday-november-9-2026</guid>
        <description>
          <![CDATA[<p><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">The Senate
stands adjourned for Pro Forma sessions only with no business conducted on the
following dates and times:</span></p><p style="text-indent:.5in"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">Thursday,
October 1<sup>st</sup> at 10:30am</span></p><p><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
Monday, October 5<sup>th</sup> at 4:00pm</span></p><p><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
Tuesday, October 6<sup>th</sup> at 1:30pm</span></p><p><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
Friday, October 9<sup>th</sup> at 1:30pm</span></p><p><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
Tuesday, October 13<sup>th</sup> at 3:30pm</span></p><p><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
Thursday, October 15<sup>th</sup> at 9:30am</span></p><p><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
Monday, October 19<sup>th</sup> at 9:00am</span></p><p><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
Thursday, October 22<sup>nd</sup> at 9:00am</span></p><p><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
Monday, October 26<sup>th</sup> at 5:30pm</span></p><p><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
Thursday, October 29<sup>th</sup> at 2:00pm</span></p><p><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
Monday, November 2<sup>nd</sup> at 4:30pm</span></p><p><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
Thursday, November 5<sup>th</sup> at 10:30am</span></p><p><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">Notwithstanding
the Senate’s adjournment, reports of committees and introduction of measures
will be authorized on Thursday, October 15<sup>th</sup> from 10:00am until
11:00am.</span></p><p><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">When the
Senate adjourns on Thursday, November 5<sup>th</sup>, it will stand adjourned
until 3:00pm on Monday, November 9, 2026.</span></p><p><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">Following
Leader remarks, the Senate will resume consideration of the motion to proceed
to Cal. #453, H.R.2347 Survivor Justice Tax Prevention Act.</span></p><p><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">At
approximately 5:30pm, the Senate will vote on the motion to invoke cloture on
the motion to proceed to Cal. #453, H.R.2347.</span></p><p><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p><p><u><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">Monday,
November 9<sup>th</sup> at approx. 5:30pm – 1 roll call vote:</span></u></p><p>













































</p><ol style="margin-top:0in">
 <li style="margin-left:0in;"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;">Motion
     to invoke cloture on motion to proceed to Cal. #453, H.R.2347 – Survivor
     Justice Tax Prevention Act</span></li>
</ol>]]>
        </description>
      </item>
      <item>
        <title>Wrap Up for Wednesday, September 30, 2026</title>
        <link>https://www.democrats.senate.gov/2026/09/30/wrap-up-for-wednesday-september-30-2026</link>
