        <guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.democrats.senate.gov/2026/09/30/wrap-up-for-wednesday-september-30-2026</guid>
        <description>
          <![CDATA[<p><b><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">Roll Call
Votes<u></u></span></b></p><ol style="margin-top:0in">
 <li style="margin-left:0in;"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;">Motion
     to invoke cloture on the motion to proceed to Cal. #548 H.R.7008, Stop
     Insider Trading Act; not agreed to: 53-47.</span></li>
 <li style="margin-left:0in;"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;">Motion
     to invoke cloture on the motion to proceed to Cal. #684, H.R.9340,
     Ratepayer Protection Act; not agreed to: 57-43.</span></li>
 <li style="margin-left:0in;"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;">Motion
     to invoke cloture on Executive Calendar #912 Keith Sonderling, of Florida,
     to be Secretary of Labor; agreed to: 53-47.</span></li>
 <li style="margin-left:0in;"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;">Confirmation
     of Executive Calendar #912 Keith Sonderling, of Florida, to be Secretary
     of Labor; confirmed: 47-41.</span></li>
</ol><p><b><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></b></p><p><b><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">Legislative
Business</span></b></p><p><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">Passed the
following bills:</span></p><p><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">Cal. #350 –
S.3798 – Safe Access to Cash Act of 2026</span></p><p><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">Cal. #365 –
S.3315, Health Care Cybersecurity and Resiliency Act of 2026 with Cassidy
substitute</span></p><p><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">Cal. #483,
S.2273- Wyoming Education Trust Modernization Act</span><span style="font-family:
&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;mso-ligatures:none"></span></p><p><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">Cal. #638,
S.2498 - National Park System Long-Term Lease Investment Act</span></p><p><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">Cal. #641,
S.2754 – Crystal Reservoir Conveyance Act</span></p><p><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">Cal. #571,
H.R.5235 – Skills-Based Federal Contracting Act</span></p><p><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">Cal. #621,
S.5249 – MORE American Fuel Act </span></p><p><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">Cal. #637,
S.2437 – Snow Water Supply Forecasting Program Reauthorization Act of 2026</span></p><p><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">Cal. #660,
H.R.837 - Pleasant Valley Ranger District Administrative Site to Gila County,
Arizona</span></p><p><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">Cal. #665,
H.R. 7831 - License to Drill</span></p><p><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">Cal. #673,
S.1514 – Quinault Indian Nation Land Transfer Act</span></p><p><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">Cal. #676,
H.R.2400 – Pit River Land Transfer Act of 2025</span></p><p><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">Cal. #681,
S.1055 – Indian Health Service Emergency Claims Parity Act</span></p><p><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">S.1564 –
Floodplain Enhancement and Recovery Act </span></p><p><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">H.R.5349 – Taxpayer
Assistance and Service Act with Crapo-Wyden substitute amendment and title
amendment</span></p><p><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">H.R.227 –
Clergy Act</span></p><p><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">H.R.1703 –
Choices For Increased Mobility</span></p><p><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">H.R.4307 -
Enhancing Detection of Human Trafficking Act</span></p><p><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">H.R. 6380 -
Chiricahua National Park Act</span></p><p><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">H.R.7022 -
Mystic Alerts Act</span></p><p><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">H.R.8352 –
Criminal History Access Act of 2026&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></p><p><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">Adopted the
following resolutions:</span></p><p><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">S.Res.866 –
