National Veterans Suicide Prevention Day</span></p><p><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">S.Res.947 -
Childhood Cancer Awareness Month</span></p><p><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">S.Res.948-
Texas A&amp;M 150<sup>th</sup> Anniversary</span></p><p><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">Completed the
Rule 14 process to place the following bills on the Legislative Calendar of
Business:</span></p><ol style="margin-top:0in">
 <li style="margin-left:0in;"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;">S.5602,
     to prohibit the use of Federal funds for the planning and construction of
     any structure or monument at Memorial Circle at Columbia Island/ Lady Bird
     Johnson Park in the District of Columbia. (Merkley)</span></li>
 <li style="margin-left:0in;"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;">S.5603,</span><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;
     mso-ligatures:none"> </span><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;
     mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;">to prohibit the demolition of
     Presidential memorials (Merkley)</span></li>
</ol><p><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p><p><b><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">Executive
Business</span></b></p><p><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">Confirmed the
